 , France\n🎤🇫🇷 PARIS IS A JOKE — THE INTERNATIONAL COMEDY SHOW! 
 🌍 Different Nationalities. Different Cultures. One Language: LAUGHTER! 
 😂 PARIS ERASMUS LIFE brings you a brand-new experience in Paris! 🔥 W
 hat happens when comedians from around the world come together to make fun
  of Paris\, French people\, cultural differences\, and the crazy situation
 s we all experience as internationals? Welcome to PARIS IS A JOKE! 🎤 Fo
 r our very first edition\, we're bringing together international stand-up 
 comedians for a hilarious night dedicated to life in Paris\, Erasmus adven
 tures\, cultural clashes\, dating\, French stereotypes\, and the funny dif
 ferences between nationalities! 🇫🇷 Why are French people always comp
 laining? 🇮🇹 Why do Italians take food so seriously? 🇪🇸 Why are
  Spanish people always late? 🇬🇧 Why is dating in Paris so complicate
 d? 🌍 And why does every nationality think they're the best? Expect hila
 rious stories\, unexpected punchlines\, international humor\, and plenty o
 f jokes about the city we all love (and sometimes hate)! 😂 Whether you'
 re an Erasmus student\, an expat\, an international student\, a tourist\, 
 or a Parisian\, this show is made for YOU! ✨ WHAT TO EXPECT? 🎤 Talent
 ed international stand-up...\n\nhttps://shotgun.live/en/events/paris-is-a-
 joke-standup-comedy-in-english
